#'   distribution used as prior in the shrinkage parameter, \eqn{\lambda^{2}}. 
#'   If \code{prior = "b_adapt_lasso"}, the \bold{shape} parameter in the gamma 
#'   distribution used as prior in the shrinkage parameters, 
