#' Nonparametric Bayesian Lasso.\emph{Journal of Computational and Graphical 
#' Statistics}, 35(2):854-864. doi:10.1080/10618600.2025.2572327
#' 
#' G. E. Moran, V. Rockova, and E. I. George (2019), Variance Prior Forms for 
